<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Le Mans Lakeside &mdash; night gallery</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#0b0d12;color:#e8ebf2;font:16px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif}
header{padding:18px 16px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #1d2230}
h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:.2px}
.hash{font:600 12px ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#8ea0c0;background:#151a26;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 7px}
h2{margin:0;font-size:17px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
p{margin:6px 0}
.lede{color:#aab4c8;font-size:14.5px;margin:0 0 6px}
.light{color:#c9b46a;font-size:13.5px;margin:0}
section{padding:16px}
.note{color:#78839c;font-size:12.5px;margin:2px 0 12px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
@media(min-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
@media(min-width:1100px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
.card{display:block;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;background:#12161f;border:1px solid #1c2230;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
.card img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;background:#05070b}
.cap{display:block;padding:7px 9px 0;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}
.sub{display:block;padding:0 9px 9px;font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#8ea0c0}
footer{padding:14px 16px 30px;color:#78839c;font-size:12.5px}
</style></head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>Le Mans Lakeside &mdash; night gallery</h1>
<p class="lede">These are <strong>offline night renders of the track model</strong> (Blender/Cycles), not in-game screenshots. Newest run first; older runs are kept so you can compare looks between builds.</p>
<p class="light">8 floodlight poles as spot lights: intensity 0.9 (Cycles 120000 W each), 65&deg; cone, 42 m range, soft falloff &middot; colour 3/2.85/2.6 &middot; deep blue sky, low ambient</p>
</header>
<section><h2>2026-09-25 <span class="hash">build e44c6df</span></h2><p class="note">16 offline night renders &middot; 24 samples &middot; 1280x720 &middot; rendered 2026-09-25T14:34:22</p><div class="grid"><a class="card" href="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/full/01-bridge-bend.jpg"><img loading="lazy" src="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/thumbs/01-bridge-bend.jpg" alt="Bridge Bend &middot; s 28 m  (section 10-56 m)"><span class="cap">Bridge Bend</span><span class="sub">s 28 m  (section 10-56 m)</span></a><a class="card" href="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/full/02-waterview-straight.jpg"><img loading="lazy" src="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/thumbs/02-waterview-straight.jpg" alt="Waterview Straight &middot; s 76 m  (section 56-116 m)"><span class="cap">Waterview Straight</span><span class="sub">s 76 m  (section 56-116 m)</span></a><a class="card" href="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/full/03-corkscrew-chicane.jpg"><img loading="lazy" src="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/thumbs/03-corkscrew-chicane.jpg" alt="Corkscrew Chicane &middot; s 127 m  (section 116-148 m)"><span class="cap">Corkscrew Chicane</span><span class="sub">s 127 m  (section 116-148 m)</span></a><a class="card" href="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/full/04-the-hook.jpg"><img loading="lazy" src="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/thumbs/04-the-hook.jpg" alt="The Hook &middot; s 163 m  (section 148-179 m)"><span class="cap">The Hook</span><span class="sub">s 163 m  (section 148-179 m)</span></a><a class="card" href="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/full/05-container-straight.jpg"><img loading="lazy" src="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/thumbs/05-container-straight.jpg" alt="Container Straight &middot; s 202 m  (section 179-224 m)"><span class="cap">Container Straight</span><span class="sub">s 202 m  (section 179-224 m)</span></a><a class="card" href="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/full/06-sweeper.jpg"><img loading="lazy" src="night/2026-09-25-e44c6df/thumbs/06-sweeper.jpg" alt="Sweeper &middot; s 230 m  (section 224-268 m)"><span class="cap">Sweeper</span><span class="sub">s 2